  "_comment": "Run `bubblewrap init --manifest https://locinsights.bayhaqy.my.id/manifest.json` to regenerate this file from the live PWA, then `bubblewrap build` to produce the APK. The public/.well-known/assetlinks.json file contains the real SHA-256 fingerprint of the local android.keystore signing key (94:31:B2:1B:3E:60:C3:C4:A8:19:4A:16:3B:9B:DE:51:FD:8C:D6:0F:8C:1F:9F:52:A0:FF:F2:BB:30:A3:68:9C). With this fingerprint published, the TWA verifies digital asset links and runs true full-screen with no browser URL bar. The keystore itself is gitignored and must be kept locally + backed up securely offline."
